{
    "title": "iHerb: Vitamins & Supplements",
    "description": "Shop iHerb for the best-curated selection of health and wellness brands, all at a great value, delivered right to your door. With products ranging from vitamins and supplements to sports nutrition, groceries, beauty, and self-care, we are the one-stop shop for health and wellness essentials for millions of happy customers globally. We make wellness better. \r\n\r\nWellness Comes Easy With The iHerb App\r\n\r\nEXCLUSIVE OFFERS\r\nAccess discounts only for iHerb App users. Save 20% on your first app order with code: APP123. Terms and conditions apply.\r\n\r\nMAXIMIZE YOUR SAVINGS WITH REWARDS\r\nShare iHerb\u2019s unbeatable value and earn Rewards credit to turn into free products or cash out. Earn even more with weekly Super Rewards.\r\n\r\nTRUSTED BRANDS\r\niHerb stores and ships over 50,000 top-quality products from trusted national brands directly from our own climate-controlled fulfillment centers with no resellers.\r\n\r\nGUARANTEED QUALITY\r\nWe test our own iHerb brand supplements for ingredient purity and potency, so you know what\u2019s on the label is what\u2019s in the bottle. We publish best-buy dates on all product descriptions so customers always get the freshest product. \r\n\r\nAUTOSHIP & SAVE\r\nNo fees or commitments. Set your delivery schedule and get the guaranteed lowest discounted price on vitamins, sports nutrition, self-care, and more. \r\n\r\nTRACK YOUR ORDERS \r\nNever miss a delivery with tracking notifications and live order updates sent directly to your phone.\r\n\r\nAUTHENTIC REVIEWS\r\nWe allow product reviews only from customers who have ordered that specific product from iHerb. This assures genuine reviews to help you make smarter buying choices.\r\n\r\nEASY RETURNS AND REFUNDS\r\nShop with confidence knowing If you are unsatisfied, you can submit your request within 30 days of purchase for hassle-free refunds.\r\n\r\nSIMPLE & SECURE CHECKOUT\r\nShop your favorite health, wellness, and fitness products smoothly and securely with 40 localized payment options in 80 currencies and more than 100 shipping carriers.\r\n\r\n24/7 CUSTOMER SERVICE\r\nWe are reachable 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, by virtual chat to answer questions and resolve issues with your order.\r\n\r\nSHOP BY CATEGORY:\r\nVitamins, Supplements, Minerals, Herbs, Antioxidants, Amino Acids, Fish Oil & Omegas, Immune Boosters, Magnesium, Collagen, Protein Powders, Pre-Workout, Creatine, Hydration & Electrolytes, Probiotics, Weight Management, Greens & Superfoods, Homeopathy, K-Beauty, Makeup, Bath & Personal Care, Moms & Maternity, Pets\r\n\r\nSHOP BY BRAND:\r\nCalifornia Gold Nutrition, Mild By Nature, Thorne, Life Extension, Eucerin, Beauty of Joseon, Natural Factors, NOW Foods, Optimum Nutrition, Nature\u2019s Way, Vital Proteins, Nordic Naturals, Goli Nutrition, Quest Nutrition, Bob's Red Mill, Simply Organic, Advanced Clinicals and many more.\r\n\r\nSHOP BY INTEREST:\r\nDigestive Support, Anti-Aging & Longevity, Cleanse and Detox; Hair, Skin & Nails; Women\u2019s Health, Bone, Joint, & Cartilage, Children\u2019s Health, Brain & Cognitive, Men\u2019s Health, Heart Health, Sleep & Mood, Stress, Eye & Vision, Seasonal Allergies, Common Cold & Flu, Pain Relief, Vegan, Vegetarian, Gluten-Free, Organic, Cruelty-Free, Non-GMO\r\n\r\nABOUT iHERB\r\niHerb is a United States-based retailer that sells more than 50,000 products across 1,800 popular brands. For over 28 years, iHerb has been the global leader in health and wellness, with products that range from vitamins and supplements to sports nutrition, grocery, beauty, self-care, pets, and products to create a healthier home. \r\n \r\nDISCLAIMER\r\nInformation on the App should not be considered a substitute for advice from a healthcare professional. The products and claims made about specific products on iHerb's App have not been evaluated by the United States Food and Drug Administration and are not approved to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent disease.",
